---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Griffith Creative | Web Design for Growing Businesses"
  description="Griffith Creative builds high-performance websites for growing businesses and established brands. Fast delivery, honest pricing, built to rank. Based in Los Angeles, working worldwide."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="min-h-[90vh] flex items-center">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 w-full">
      <p class="font-mono text-offwhite-muted text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-8">
        Based in Los Angeles. Working worldwide.
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-[clamp(3rem,8vw,6rem)] leading-[0.95] tracking-tight mb-10 max-w-6xl">
        Websites that look<br />
        <span class="text-accent">as good as they work.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mb-12">
        We build websites for growing businesses and established brands. What traditional agencies take months to deliver, we ship in weeks, without the agency bloat.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="border border-offwhite/30 text-offwhite font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded text-center hover:border-offwhite/60 transition-colors"
        >
          Start Your Project
        </a>
        <a
          href="/enterprise"
          class="border border-accent/40 text-accent font-semibold px-8 py-4 rounded text-center hover:border-accent transition-colors"
        >
          Enterprise Solutions
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The argument -->
  <section class="border-t border-offwhite/10 py-32">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mb-20">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-8">
          Most agency websites are overpriced and underbuilt.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
          You've seen the pitch: months of process, layers of account management, and a site that loads slower than your patience runs out. Your customers are searching for you right now. They're finding your competitors instead.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-x-12 gap-y-10">
        <div class="border-t border-offwhite/15 pt-6">
          <p class="font-mono text-offwhite-muted text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Delivery</p>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite text-2xl mb-3">Weeks, not months</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We scope tight, build fast, and launch on schedule. Your site goes live while competitors are still in discovery.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-offwhite/15 pt-6">
          <p class="font-mono text-offwhite-muted text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Pricing</p>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite text-2xl mb-3">Quoted up front</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            You know the scope and the number before we start. Modern tooling keeps our overhead low, and the price honest.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-offwhite/15 pt-6">
          <p class="font-mono text-offwhite-muted text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Search</p>
          <h3 class="text-offwhite text-2xl mb-3">Built to be found</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Clean structure, schema markup, and semantic HTML, so the site ranks on Google and gets cited by AI search engines from day one.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who We Work With -->
  <section class="border-t border-offwhite/10 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-offwhite-muted text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-6">
            Who We Work With
          </p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6 text-balance">
            Businesses that need to be found and trusted online.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Your customers decide whether to trust you before they ever pick up the phone. We build digital presences that earn that trust: clean, professional, and optimized to convert.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite text-lg mb-2">Service Businesses</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              From professional practices to home services. If your business depends on trust and reputation, your website needs to reflect that. We build sites that convert visitors into clients.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite text-lg mb-2">Local Businesses</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Brick-and-mortar shops, multi-location operators, and local service providers. We build websites that put you on the map and close the deal.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite text-lg mb-2">Growing Companies</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              B2B firms, consultancies, and startups that have outgrown their DIY website and need a digital presence that matches the caliber of their work.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border-l-2 border-accent pl-6">
            <h3 class="text-offwhite text-lg mb-2">Established Brands</h3>
            <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              High-traffic sites with real stakes: legacy platforms to migrate, infrastructure to modernize, and teams that need a partner on call. <a href="/enterprise" class="text-offwhite underline decoration-accent underline-offset-4 hover:text-accent transition-colors">See our enterprise practice</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="border-t border-offwhite/10 py-24">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-offwhite-muted text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-16">
        How It Works
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-x-12 gap-y-10">
        <div class="border-t border-offwhite/15 pt-6">
          <h3 class="text-offwhite text-2xl mb-3">Discovery Call</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            A 15-minute call to understand your business, your customers, and your goals. We'll define scope and timeline on the spot.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-offwhite/15 pt-6">
          <h3 class="text-offwhite text-2xl mb-3">Build & Review</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We build your site and send a working preview within days. Revision rounds are included. You stay focused on your business while we handle the rest.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-offwhite/15 pt-6">
          <h3 class="text-offwhite text-2xl mb-3">Launch & Grow</h3>
          <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Your site goes live, built to rank from day one. Need ongoing support after launch? Our Care Plan covers it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="border-t border-offwhite/10 py-32">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight mb-6">
        Your website should be<br />your best salesperson.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-offwhite-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        Tell us what you're building. We'll tell you exactly how we'd ship it.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block bg-accent text-dark font-bold px-10 py-4 rounded hover:bg-accent-hover transition-colors text-lg"
      >
        Let's Talk
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
